From 41956fd96d7aebb8e2b01905a0d03ce4c05a5a1f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 02:22:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Zeppelin F-223A: remove Forever Lighting and colour grading,
 grass radius cap 512, lamp light full resolution by default

- hdForever / hdForeverLight gone: the Forever light, band and ambient overrides return the stock values (the
  forever_data tables still load for the fog); hdGrade gone: neither renderer runs the grade, HD::VulkanGrade not made
- groundEffectDist cap 1024 -> 512 (WorldParam_CVar, ZepCVarRanges)
- hdLightPassResolution default 0 (full): half looked too soft to the user

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UHcJJVC4feQ4s15e9bNRoN
---
 .../Source/Gx/CGxDeviceVulkan/CGxDeviceVulkan.cpp   | 13 ++-----------
 .../Gx/CGxDeviceVulkan/hd/HdVulkanLightPass.cpp     |  2 +-
 .../wxl/src/native/render/WorldPass.cpp             |  1 -
 WoW/Source/Ui/WorldFrame.cpp                        |  4 ++--
 WoW/Source/Ui/ZepCVarRanges.cpp                     |  2 +-
 WoW/Source/WorldClient/HD/HdForever.cpp             |  4 ++--
 WoW/Source/WorldClient/WorldParam_CVar.cpp          |  4 ++--
 7 files changed, 10 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

